"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-09-09 12:00+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: AnduinOS Team <anduin@aiursoft.com>\n"
"Language-Team: ja\n"
"Language: ja_JP\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
